WEBVTT

00:00:20.720 --> 00:00:23.500
Is that... Could it be?

00:00:27.300 --> 00:00:28.710
<i>A hydra!</i>

00:00:29.410 --> 00:00:31.400
<i>Hi there. It's me, Arc.</i>

00:00:31.860 --> 00:00:36.880
<i>We had traveled to the Holy Revlon 
Empire in search of kidnapped elves,</i>

00:00:37.660 --> 00:00:40.870
<i>and now we have to fight this abomination.</i>

00:00:45.560 --> 00:00:49.100
That must be the infamous 
ruiner of nations...

00:00:49.100 --> 00:00:51.800
Do you suppose the man from 
before is controlling it?

00:00:51.800 --> 00:00:53.280
There can be no doubt.

00:00:54.480 --> 00:00:57.380
To think humans can control
a beast of such scale...

00:01:04.250 --> 00:01:06.460
<i>And there are the rings, again.</i>

00:01:06.460 --> 00:01:09.830
We need to prepare more 
before engaging this foe.

00:01:09.830 --> 00:01:11.670
I propose a retreat.

00:01:15.000 --> 00:01:16.340
It's noticed us!

00:01:29.000 --> 00:01:32.260
Wiped off the bloody map! Serves 'em right!

00:01:32.260 --> 00:01:33.410
How's that?!

00:01:33.410 --> 00:01:35.360
How do you like a taste of my power?!

00:01:43.620 --> 00:01:45.420
What don't you geezers understand?!

00:01:45.420 --> 00:01:47.630
Why won't you give me the credit I'm due?!

00:01:47.640 --> 00:01:50.690
No one in this clan can compare to me!

00:01:53.000 --> 00:01:54.140
Fumba...

00:01:54.730 --> 00:01:56.470
You are weak.

00:01:56.470 --> 00:01:57.780
What?!

00:01:57.780 --> 00:02:01.620
In your weakness, you seek 
out superficial strength.

00:02:02.860 --> 00:02:08.440
How can you expect our approval 
when you are devoid of discipline?

00:02:11.760 --> 00:02:15.670
Fumba, a cur of your 
standing would ordinarily

00:02:15.670 --> 00:02:21.000
never be allowed an audience 
with His Imperial Highness.

00:02:21.000 --> 00:02:24.840
You needn't be so caustic, Velmoas.

00:02:24.840 --> 00:02:25.650
Sire!

00:02:26.300 --> 00:02:30.210
A monster sorcerer... How amusing.

00:02:30.970 --> 00:02:35.170
If your abilities benefit the empire, 
I will not question your standing.

00:02:35.600 --> 00:02:38.630
Show me your power, Fumba.

00:02:48.520 --> 00:02:51.120
This is the hydra's power!

00:02:51.120 --> 00:02:54.160
And with it, I'm unstoppable!

00:02:54.160 --> 00:03:00.200
Everyone who looked down on me 
will all be bowing to me!

00:03:00.460 --> 00:03:05.200
It's feeding time! 
Go and gorge yourself on that city!

00:03:06.460 --> 00:03:11.350
Your Imperial Highness, 
I'm helping myself to one of your towns

00:03:12.010 --> 00:03:15.710
because a pet needs 
to have a healthy diet...

00:03:15.710 --> 00:03:18.000
where it can eat its fill!

00:03:28.590 --> 00:03:30.400
We're alive...?

00:03:30.400 --> 00:03:32.580
I'm glad the shield was 
able to activate in time.

00:03:36.060 --> 00:03:40.060
You defended against an attack 
that could level a fortress with a <i>shield</i>?

00:03:40.060 --> 00:03:43.160
What in the world are you, Sir Arc?

00:03:44.640 --> 00:03:48.170
Just the traveling mercenary 
hired by Lady Ariane...

00:03:48.170 --> 00:03:50.990
Wait, where is Lady Ariane?

00:03:51.710 --> 00:03:55.460
Lady Ariane! Lady Ariane? Lady Ariane—

00:03:57.550 --> 00:03:59.210
L-Lady Ariane...?

00:04:00.530 --> 00:04:03.990
I wasn't unconscious at the time, you know.

00:04:04.730 --> 00:04:07.040
But I was under a layer of illusions 
that kept being re-cast...

00:04:07.040 --> 00:04:09.100
And couldn't move.

00:04:09.420 --> 00:04:13.620
Which means I could hear what 
he said. I know what he did.

00:04:14.940 --> 00:04:16.140
Come on, Arc.

00:04:17.320 --> 00:04:19.220
Let's find him.

00:04:20.120 --> 00:04:21.400
And then...

00:04:23.340 --> 00:04:25.920
for making me angry...

00:04:25.920 --> 00:04:28.570
and especially for what 
he's done to my kin...

00:04:28.570 --> 00:04:30.250
we'll fill him with regret.

00:04:31.750 --> 00:04:34.890
I agree with wanting 
to defeat the monster tamer.

00:04:34.890 --> 00:04:39.460
His control over that hydra makes him too 
great a threat for my people to ignore!

00:04:40.610 --> 00:04:43.700
He'll think that we're dead already.

00:04:44.190 --> 00:04:46.270
That'll provide the perfect 
opportunity for an ambush.

00:04:46.680 --> 00:04:48.450
Arc, let's go.

00:04:51.000 --> 00:04:51.940
Arc?

00:04:53.850 --> 00:04:57.740
What about the hydra? 
It's heading towards town.

00:04:57.740 --> 00:04:59.680
There's little that can be done.

00:04:59.680 --> 00:05:02.870
It's a giant monster that's earned 
a reputation as a ruiner of nations...

00:05:02.870 --> 00:05:05.960
It's like a force of nature itself.

00:05:06.600 --> 00:05:07.740
We can't...

00:05:07.740 --> 00:05:10.100
No, I'd say it's nothing like that.

00:05:10.810 --> 00:05:14.170
Nothing can be done 
to stop earthquakes and cyclones,

00:05:14.170 --> 00:05:16.210
but a hydra can be killed.

00:05:16.870 --> 00:05:19.660
Th-That's technically true, but...

00:05:19.660 --> 00:05:21.710
You think you can handle it, don't you?

00:05:22.130 --> 00:05:23.300
But of course!

00:05:24.440 --> 00:05:27.190
Chiyome, let's find the bastard.

00:05:27.780 --> 00:05:28.890
Right!

00:05:28.890 --> 00:05:29.720
Arc.

00:05:30.600 --> 00:05:31.780
Take care of it.

00:05:39.720 --> 00:05:43.630
I have an update, Holy Emperor Domitianus.

00:05:44.370 --> 00:05:47.700
The ruiner of nations has grown as expected,

00:05:47.700 --> 00:05:52.590
and will be ready to be fielded shortly.

00:05:53.670 --> 00:05:55.420
That is good to hear.

00:05:55.660 --> 00:06:03.360
The employ rings being crafted from analyzing 
Fumba's sorcery are nearly complete, as well.

00:06:03.360 --> 00:06:09.390
Though control over the hydra
still requires that we use him.

00:06:10.240 --> 00:06:14.960
But all the same, I should decide 
what I'm going to do with Fumba.

00:06:39.290 --> 00:06:41.780
Wh-What is that beast?!

00:06:41.780 --> 00:06:43.880
Prepare the men for battle!

00:06:43.880 --> 00:06:46.780
Have all the citizens evacuate 
to the northern side of the city!

00:06:46.780 --> 00:06:49.310
Seal the interior gates
once the soldiers have taken to the field!

00:06:49.520 --> 00:06:53.840
We will defend the land and citizenry entrusted 
to us by His Imperial Highness!

00:06:58.810 --> 00:07:00.200
Wyvern Slash!

00:07:00.230 --> 00:07:01.690
<b>W
