00:07:25.010 --> 00:07:27.340
And then chained into an...

00:07:27.340 --> 00:07:30.050
Armor Lariat!

00:07:29.050 --> 00:07:30.720
<b>Armor
Lariat
!!</b>

00:07:40.120 --> 00:07:42.770
What the hell is that rust bucket made of?!

00:07:42.770 --> 00:07:46.900
It's bizarre enough he's alive 
after taking the hydra's breath!

00:07:53.590 --> 00:07:54.900
Dimension Move!

