00:07:59.630 --> 00:08:01.160
The breath attack was a feint, then?

00:08:04.970 --> 00:08:08.840
Sacrificing a head in order 
to defeat me, eh?

00:08:14.730 --> 00:08:16.020
Oops!

00:08:20.600 --> 00:08:23.360
From the top-tier class, Sacred Knight...

00:08:25.310 --> 00:08:28.320
Combat Skill: Judgment!

00:08:39.290 --> 00:08:43.150
Regenerating, as expected. 
How very resilient.

00:08:43.150 --> 00:08:46.080
It's easy to see how this creature 
left its mark on mythology.

00:08:51.320 --> 00:08:54.640
I've never used this 
particular magic skill before...

00:08:55.280 --> 00:08:57.740
It is powerful, and its scale is grand,

00:08:57.740 --> 00:09:00.730
meaning I cannot maintain it for long.

00:09:02.890 --> 00:09:05.110
This will be over in five minutes!

00:09:05.110 --> 00:09:09.900
I summon the Infernal Demon, Ifrit!

00:09:25.050 --> 00:09:31.760
Now, ruiner of nations, you will 
go no further, and know no escape!

00:09:34.010 --> 00:09:39.010
Episode 12

00:09:34.010 --> 00:09:39.010
I Shall Cut Through the World's Evils!

00:09:47.440 --> 00:09:49.360
What in the world is that?

00:09:51.740 --> 00:09:52.720
Ponta!

00:09:55.380 --> 00:09:57.000
What the hell is that?

00:09:57.000 --> 00:10:00.520
Did the rust bucket summon that thing?

00:10:02.870 --> 00:10:05.460
<i>Hydra! Show that monster—</i>

00:10:10.750 --> 00:10:11.960
There you are.

00:10:13.300 --> 00:10:15.940
Oh, if it ain't the dark elf beauty.

00:10:15.940 --> 00:10:19.560
What's this about? 
You here to be mine, after all?

00:10:19.560 --> 00:10:22.510
No. I'm here to kill you.

00:10:23.870 --> 00:10:26.980
Look, sweetheart, 
I know you're a tough customer...

00:10:27.480 --> 00:10:29.720
but don't get too cocky!

00:10:29.720 --> 00:10:30.540
Cocky?

00:10:31.070 --> 00:10:32.560
Well, yeah!

00:10:32.560 --> 00:10:34.200
You've seen what the hydra can do, right?

00:10:34.200 --> 00:10:38.450
Compared to it, 
you're less than a fart in the wind!

00:10:38.450 --> 00:10:39.800
You're right.

00:10:39.800 --> 00:10:43.060
The hydra is strong. 
Its power is beyond comprehension.

00:10:43.920 --> 00:10:46.840
But that power isn't yours.

00:10:46.840 --> 00:10:47.740
What?!

00:10:47.740 --> 00:10:50.460
You, yourself, are weak.

00:10:51.510 --> 00:10:52.680
Weak?!

00:10:52.680 --> 00:10:55.680
Me, the master of the bloody hydra?!

00:10:55.680 --> 00:10:56.440
That's right.

00:10:56.970 --> 00:11:01.450
You're weak, so you try to make a display 
of strength by controlling that abomination.

00:11:01.450 --> 00:11:05.390
You trample over the powerless in an attempt 
to distract from your own weakness.

00:11:06.120 --> 00:11:07.420
Fumba...

00:11:07.800 --> 00:11:09.520
You are weak.

00:11:09.830 --> 00:11:11.770
Show me your power, Fumba.

00:11:12.210 --> 00:11:14.480
Damn it. Her, too, eh?

00:11:14.480 --> 00:11:17.880
The truly strong do not become conceited.

00:11:18.620 --> 00:11:21.020
And they don't hesitate to use
their strength to defend the powerless.

00:11:21.640 --> 00:11:24.500
I've learned that from the people around me.

00:11:25.580 --> 00:11:28.540
That's the kind of strength I seek!

00:11:30.220 --> 00:11:32.750
You're pissing me off.

00:11:36.840 --> 00:11:39.430
Every last one of you is pissing me off!

00:11:39.740 --> 00:11:45.210
No one wants to admit how good I am, 
so I'll crush you all!

00:11:51.390 --> 00:11:54.320
You're pretty fast, all right! And yet...

00:12:02.550 --> 00:12:04.690
This is the power you were talking about?

00:12:05.570 --> 00:12:10.540
I'm not forgiving enough to fall 
for the same trick twice.

00:12:10.540 --> 00:12:12.330
You piece of trash...!

00:12:12.330 --> 00:12:15.500
Stop looking at me like that!

00:12:16.400 --> 00:12:19.590
Maybe I'll let the hydra 
take another shot at you!

00:12:21.300 --> 00:12:22.930
Stupid brat!

00:12:25.040 --> 00:12:26.220
The pattern...!

00:12:27.400 --> 00:12:28.860
I thought as much.

00:12:29.240 --> 00:12:33.380
Those complex cursed markings 
were what let you control monsters.

00:12:34.060 --> 00:12:36.170
It's a remarkable technique.

00:12:36.980 --> 00:12:42.580
But because of their intricacy, 
the slightest disruption...

00:12:42.580 --> 00:12:45.780
...is enough to make them stop working, right?

00:12:46.040 --> 00:12:48.760
What have you bitches done?!

00:12:49.480 --> 00:12:52.440
Don't blame me for what happens now!

00:12:52.440 --> 00:12:55.460
The hydra's beyond my control!

00:12:55.460 --> 00:12:59.310
It's not gonna stop until it's 
eaten everyone in that town!

00:13:02.680 --> 00:13:04.560
It's all right, Chiyome.

00:13:05.730 --> 00:13:09.660
That monster will never kill again.

00:13:10.860 --> 00:13:12.080
Not with Arc around.

00:13:19.300 --> 00:13:21.270
Now... Now, hold on a tick...

00:13:27.270 --> 00:13:30.630
I was just doing what 
the damned emperor ordered me to!

00:13:30.630 --> 00:13:34.210
I'll apologize for killing 
my share of elves, even!

00:13:34.830 --> 00:13:36.970
I don't need your apologies.

00:13:37.920 --> 00:13:42.140
You can give them to the people 
you killed, when you see them.

00:13:42.140 --> 00:13:43.580
W-Wait...

00:13:43.580 --> 00:13:48.350
Blazing embers, heed my call. 
Consume all to ash!

00:13:51.490 --> 00:13:53.920
Shit! Shit, shit, shit...!

00:13:53.920 --> 00:13:56.790
Shit!

00:13:56.790 --> 00:14:01.760
Though I doubt you'll be seeing them, 
since you'll be in Hell.

00:14:30.570 --> 00:14:32.040
You're not escaping!

00:14:50.610 --> 00:14:53.400
Ifrit! Flame Hellion!

00:14:54.330 --> 00:14:55.870
<b>Flame Hellion</b>

00:15:02.880 --> 00:15:05.460
Um... do you suppose that's...?

00:15:05.460 --> 00:15:08.330
For someone who talks 
about wanting the quiet life,

00:15:08.330 --> 00:15:10.680
he never hesitates to make a spectacle.

00:15:16.160 --> 00:15:17.500
It seems that's the end of it.

00:15:28.530 --> 00:15:29.710
Hey!

00:15:33.600 --> 00:15:35.820
I'm glad to see you two are all right.

00:15:35.820 --> 00:15:37.570
Did you settle things on this end?

00:15:37.570 --> 00:15:40.130
Yes, thankfully.

00:15:40.130 --> 00:15:44.240
Putting that aside... what exactly is that?

00:15:44.240 --> 00:15:46.760
A creature summoned from another dimension.

00:15:46.760 --> 00:15:50.080
No worries, it should 
disappear after another minute.

00:15:50.080 --> 00:15:52.160
You don't do anything in half-steps, do you?

00:15:52.970 --> 00:15:57.710
After a display like that, you'll be lucky 
if people don't start worshiping it...

00:15:58.810 --> 00:16:00.720
Oh, I highly doubt that!

00:16:03.640 --> 00:16:04.440
Oh...

00:16:04.440 --> 00:16:06.140
A Whispering Fowl?

00:16:06.150 --> 00:16:07.970
It's from Danka.

00:16:09.300 --> 00:16:11.550
This is Danka. I have news.

00:16:11.550 --> 00:16:12.820
News?

00:16:13.320 --> 00:16:16.210
Rhoden's second princess, Yuriarna,

00:16:16.210 --> 00:16:20.700
has met with one of the great 
elven elders, Lord Fangas.

00:16:32.580 --> 00:16:35.840
You're saying the Rhoden 
Kingdom will take responsibility

00:16:35.840 --> 00:16:39.640
for searching for our missing kin?

00:16:39.640 --> 00:16:41.940
Yes, Lord Fangas.

00:16:41.940 --> 00:16:44.200
The persecution of these elves,

00:16:44.200 --> 00:16:47.610
and the breaking of our 
long-held pact, are crimes of men.

00:16:47.610 --> 00:16:50.730
I swear, by the honor of the Rhoden 
royal family, to atone for them.

00:16:51.910 --> 00:16:54.860
I gratefully accept your offer.

00:16:54.860 --> 00:17:00.450
I can't help but think 
that there's more to it, however.

00:17:02.380 --> 00:17:05.440
My older brother, the first prince, Sekt,

00:17:05.440 --> 00:17:08.940
has the Great Revlon Empire's backing.

00:17:08.940 --> 00:17:12.480
And my late brother, 
the second prince, Dakares,

00:17:12.480 --> 00:17:15.030
had the Holy Revlon Empire backing him.

00:17:15.430 --> 00:17:17.640
I've heard as much.

00:17:18.020 --> 00:17:22.780
Eastern and western Revlon are both heirs 
to their shared culture and history,

00:17:22.780 --> 00:17:25.540
where other races have faced 
all matter of subjugation.

00:17:26.290 --> 00:17:29.500
Should a monarch with their 
backing take the throne,

00:17:29.500 --> 00:17:34.620
I fear that cases such as these, 
that threaten elves, will continue.

00:17:34.620 --> 00:17:35.960
I see.

00:17:35.960 --> 00:17:41.040
Then, in order to prevent such an outcome, 
you'd ask for our backing

00:17:41.040 --> 00:17:43.570
to make sure that you obtain 
succession to the throne?

00:17:45.030 --> 00:17:50.440
And in exchange, 
should Revlon invade elvish territory,

00:17:50.440 --> 00:17:54.280
our kingdom will stake its 
survival on defending your lands.

00:17:59.090 --> 00:18:01.290
With this arrangement in place,

00:18:01.290 --> 00:18:04.600
I could ask for nothing 
more than a future where

00:18:04.600 --> 00:18:06.330
our nations, and peoples, grow closer!

00:18:06.330 --> 00:18:08.440
Your offer sounds good.

00:18:08.440 --> 00:18:10.680
You're mistaken, Lord Fangas...

00:18:13.640 --> 00:18:18.920
You've already heard how the 
Lord of Lamburt has taken an elf wife, yes?

00:18:19.840 --> 00:18:21.680
Humans and elves...

00:18:21.680 --> 00:18:26.630
The time for mutual co-existence 
may already be at hand.

00:18:27.940 --> 00:18:32.090
I have the feeling we will be 
great neighbors, Princess Yuriarna.

00:18:33.480 --> 00:18:35.020
Thank you so much.

00:18:45.720 --> 00:18:47.540
Lady Ariane...

00:18:47.540 --> 00:18:50.900
Is the news from Sir Danka 
not sitting well with you?

00:18:51.790 --> 00:18:54.690
I can imagine being dismissed 
from your duty so abruptly is unsettling.

00:18:54.930 --> 00:18:56.610
Well... yes.

00:18:56.610 --> 00:19:02.070
I know I don't have to search 
for our missing kin anymore, but...

00:19:02.070 --> 00:19:04.210
It's just so sudden.

00:19:04.210 --> 00:19:05.470
True enough.

00:19:05.470 --> 00:19:11.390
Of course, it's wonderful that Rhoden will be 
taking action to find the missing elves.

00:19:11.390 --> 00:19:12.520
But...

00:19:13.630 --> 00:19:18.380
I'm surprised that humans would be willing to take 
that kind of action for elves.

00:19:20.350 --> 00:19:24.060
Do you remember what Carcy said before?

00:19:24.270 --> 00:19:29.400
A time will come where humans 
and elves can live hand-in-hand.

00:19:29.740 --> 00:19:34.360
At the time, I thought 
there was no chance, but...

00:19:35.350 --> 00:19:38.640
It seems the time Sir Carcy envisioned

00:19:38.640 --> 00:19:41.320
may be here sooner than anyone had thought.

00:19:41.320 --> 00:19:44.010
This just feels so strange.

00:19:44.010 --> 00:19:47.530
Since meeting you, Arc, 
I, and the others...

00:19:48.140 --> 00:19:53.540
No, it's like the entire 
world has started to change.

00:19:55.360 --> 00:19:59.040
You have such a vivid 
imagination, Lady Ariane!

00:19:59.040 --> 00:20:00.760
I don't see how it's funny!

00:20:00.760 --> 00:20:03.240
Still, a world where judgment 
is delivered to the wicked,

00:20:03.240 --> 00:20:05.480
and salvation is offered to the just...

00:20:05.480 --> 00:20:09.640
With Sir Arc, a world 
that makes the right kind of sense...

00:20:09.640 --> 00:20:11.190
Seems like it may be possible.

00:20:17.390 --> 00:20:19.400
Yuriarna survived?

00:20:19.400 --> 00:20:20.490
Yes, sir.

00:20:20.490 --> 00:20:23.140
Her negotiations with the elves 
have been successful, as well.

00:20:23.140 --> 00:20:27.350
It seems she's on the verge 
of winning the people's favor.

00:20:28.200 --> 00:20:30.160
And at this rate, the throne...

00:20:31.200 --> 00:20:34.670
<i>The assassination failed? No.</i>

00:20:36.160 --> 00:20:40.440
<i>Someone working for me must 
have sided with Yuriarna.</i>

00:20:41.470 --> 00:20:43.140
<i>Still...</i>

00:20:44.530 --> 00:20:46.480
If that's the case, so be it.

00:20:46.480 --> 00:20:50.260
Rhoden's prosperity will 
simply take a alternate path.

00:20:55.810 --> 00:20:59.600
I know that, in that moment, I died.

00:21:00.830 --> 00:21:03.170
If I am alive again,

00:21:03.170 --> 00:21:07.250
it means there is something 
I must accomplish in this world.

00:21:07.250 --> 00:21:10.830
Which means I must seek 
that goal out, without hesitation.

00:21:12.130 --> 00:21:15.170
Isn't that right, my angel?

00:21:21.480 --> 00:21:23.500
The hydra was killed?

00:21:23.500 --> 00:21:26.710
Yes, and Fumba, as well.

00:21:26.710 --> 00:21:27.980
I see.

00:21:28.530 --> 00:21:30.540
Well, it won't be a problem.

00:21:30.540 --> 00:21:35.180
The employ rings have already 
proven their usefulness.

00:21:35.180 --> 00:21:36.400
Of course.

00:21:36.860 --> 00:21:43.360
Although I am curious about 
who exactly slew the great beast...

00:21:45.820 --> 00:21:48.080
What was that, Arc? Are you getting sick?

00:21:48.080 --> 00:21:49.110
No...

00:21:49.110 --> 00:21:52.590
Perhaps someone, somewhere, 
is talking about me.

00:21:52.590 --> 00:21:54.080
What are you talking about?

00:21:54.970 --> 00:21:58.130
Well, this matter has been brought 
to a successful close.

00:21:58.130 --> 00:22:02.500
I suppose I will quietly, 
inconspicuously, continue my adventures.

00:22:02.760 --> 00:22:03.970
Quietly?

00:22:03.970 --> 00:22:05.330
Inconspicuously?

00:22:05.330 --> 00:22:08.760
After what you just did, 
how can you say that with a straight face?

00:22:09.610 --> 00:22:10.720
See for yourself!

00:22:10.720 --> 00:22:13.640
S-S-S-Skeleton?!

00:22:14.500 --> 00:22:16.190
What's the matter, Lady Chiyome?

00:22:16.190 --> 00:22:20.750
Oh, right, you've never seen 
 Arc unmasked before...

00:22:20.750 --> 00:22:24.600
He's apparently under some kind of curse 
that makes him look like this.

00:22:25.080 --> 00:22:26.520
Uh, Chiyome?

00:22:29.620 --> 00:22:34.370
So, Lady Ariane, what will you 
do after returning to Lalatoya?

00:22:34.370 --> 00:22:36.300
I'll show you the way to the Lord Crown.

00:22:36.820 --> 00:22:39.410
We need to make sure you get to the spring.

00:22:39.410 --> 00:22:40.540
The spring...

00:22:40.540 --> 00:22:44.200
The one that can break any curse. 
Did you forget?

00:22:44.200 --> 00:22:46.360
Oh, that's right!

00:22:46.360 --> 00:22:49.360
The spring near the lair of the dragon lord!

00:22:49.360 --> 00:22:51.550
How truly fantastical!

00:22:51.550 --> 00:22:54.010
F-Fantastical...?

00:22:54.010 --> 00:22:55.800
I know, Lady Chiyome!

00:22:55.800 --> 00:22:59.480
If it's possible, 
I'd love to visit your ninja village!

00:22:59.480 --> 00:23:02.770
Uh... Well... right.

00:23:02.770 --> 00:23:05.940
We'd love to host you... Yes.

00:23:08.290 --> 00:23:11.550
<i>So, here we are again. It's me, Arc.</i>

00:23:11.550 --> 00:23:16.660
<i>My journey that began 
with a goal of living the quiet life...</i>

00:23:16.660 --> 00:23:21.150
<i>will now continue, 
after making many new friends.</i>

00:23:22.120 --> 00:23:26.940
<i>I still have no idea why 
I have come to this world.</i>

00:23:28.090 --> 00:23:30.520
<i>But it's of no concern right now.</i>

00:23:32.000 --> 00:23:38.250
<i>I'll simply enjoy my adventures 
here for a bit longer.</i>

00:23:44.980 --> 00:23:50.270
<b>A lot of stuff got done here, and now the final episode is complete! We're grateful!
#DirectorDesk HangingWithPonta</b>

00:23:44.980 --> 00:23:50.270
<b>Thanks for watching!!</b>

00:23:44.980 --> 00:23:50.270
<b>Director: Katsumi Ono</b>
